                                "sense_id": "596337c8-690c-3b81-8c9e-cc82ddc4d3e4",
                                "text": "WEAVER STEPHEN soon enlightened me as to Mr. Knockey's meaning. \"Things are getting very numbersome now, sir, — oncommon I call it.\""
                            }
